#: R/decisioncompare.b.R
msgid ""
"Cochran's Q is undefined for these data: every case was classified "
"identically by all three tests (all correct, or all incorrect), leaving no "
"discordance for the statistic to use. This means the data cannot separate "
"the tests, not that the analysis failed."
